  var rs=subject.GetComponentsInChildren<Renderer>();int tris=SubjectMeshes().Sum(m=>m.triangles.Length/3);EditorGUILayout.HelpBox($"Subject: {tris:N0} triangles • {rs.SelectMany(r=>r.sharedMaterials).Distinct().Count()} materials • {rs.Count(r=>r.shadowCastingMode!=ShadowCastingMode.Off&&r.sharedMaterials.Any(m=>m&&m.GetShaderPassEnabled("ShadowCaster")))} shadow-casting renderers\nLOD: {(subject.GetComponentInChildren<LODGroup>()?"LOD "+ActiveLod():"Near; no automatic LODGroup")}. Editor update: {editorFps:0.0} Hz / {1000/Mathf.Max(1,editorFps):0.0} ms. Last synchronous capture: {previewMs:0.0} ms.\nEditor global draw calls: {UnityStats.drawCalls}; batches: {UnityStats.batches}. These are editor-wide, not isolated gameplay FPS.",MessageType.Info);
  if(s.preset==5)EditorGUILayout.HelpBox(prod.provenance+"\nTemperature slider uses a custom production RGB; switch preset for Kelvin lighting.",MessageType.None);
  EditorGUILayout.HelpBox("Color space: "+QualitySettings.activeColorSpace+". Compare Gamma / Linear only in the isolated copy. No production color-space toggle.",MessageType.Info);
  if(File.Exists(Root+"Last-Lab-State.json")&&GUILayout.Button("Load saved lab settings")){var saved=JsonUtility.FromJson<State>(File.ReadAllText(Root+"Last-Lab-State.json"));RestoreDiagnosticMaterials();ApplyPreset(saved.preset);s=saved;Apply();if(!s.normals||s.normalStrength!=1||s.materialOverride)Diagnostics(s.materialOverride);}
  if(GUILayout.Button("Save lab scene settings")){File.WriteAllText(Root+"Last-Lab-State.json",JsonUtility.ToJson(s,true));RestoreDiagnosticMaterials();EditorSceneManager.SaveScene(SceneManager.GetActiveScene());}
  if(GUILayout.Button("Restore production pipeline and close lab")){RestoreDiagnosticMaterials();Restore();EditorSceneManager.NewScene(NewSceneSetup.EmptyScene,NewSceneMode.Single);Close();}
  EditorGUILayout.EndScrollView();if(EditorGUI.EndChangeCheck()){Apply();EditorApplication.QueuePlayerLoopUpdate();}Repaint();
 }
 static void RestoreDiagnosticMaterials(){if(diagnosticBase==null)return;var map=diagnosticLive.Select((m,i)=>(m,i)).ToDictionary(p=>p.m,p=>diagnosticBase[p.i]);foreach(var r in subject.GetComponentsInChildren<Renderer>())r.sharedMaterials=r.sharedMaterials.Select(m=>map.TryGetValue(m,out var b)?b:m).ToArray();foreach(var m in diagnosticLive)Object.DestroyImmediate(m);diagnosticBase=null;diagnosticLive=null;}
 static void ReplaceSubject(GameObject asset){RestoreDiagnosticMaterials();Object.DestroyImmediate(subject);var parent=new GameObject("Inactive subject staging");parent.SetActive(false);subject=(GameObject)PrefabUtility.InstantiatePrefab(asset,parent.transform);PrefabUtility.UnpackPrefabInstance(subject,PrefabUnpackMode.Completely,InteractionMode.AutomatedAction);foreach(var b in subject.GetComponentsInChildren<MonoBehaviour>(true))Object.DestroyImmediate(b);subject.transform.SetParent(null);subject.SetActive(true);subject.transform.position=Vector3.zero;var bounds=BoundsOf(subject);subject.transform.position=new Vector3(-bounds.center.x,-bounds.min.y,-bounds.center.z);subject.name="Subject pad — replace through lab panel";Object.DestroyImmediate(parent);Apply();}
}
